# Online multiplayer needs a shared key-value store so every player's
# browser (and every Vercel serverless instance) sees the same room state.
# Without these two vars the app still runs -- it falls back to an
# in-process memory store, which is fine for local dev but means rooms
# won't be visible across multiple serverless instances in production.
#
# Get these free from https://console.upstash.com -> create a Redis
# database -> REST API section.

UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
